OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry with
OL,6,Fclear spells in the evening. Cloud
OL,7,Fwill increase from the late evening
OL,8,Fand outbreaks of light rain or drizzle
OL,9,Fwill spread east towards morning.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FAny early rain soon clearing
OL,12,Fthen mainly dry, chance of some
OL,13,Fbrightness in the north. Outbreaks of
OL,14,Frain will spread east later in the
OL,15,Fafternoon and evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
